// target_name — the CANONICAL `<arch>-<os>` name of an own-backend target: the exact spelling
// `target_from_name` accepts as canonical (its format-named aliases are deliberately NOT produced
// here) and the spelling the `[extern.libs.<os-arch>]` section key, the `on "<os-arch>"` regressor
//
